    {
      "associatedLayout": "Stage",
      "name": "StaminaManagement",
      "events": [
        {
          "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment",
          "color": {
            "b": 109,
            "g": 230,
            "r": 255,
            "textB": 0,
            "textG": 0,
            "textR": 0
          },
          "comment": "Stamina should be regenerate only:\nIf not currently dashing or dead.\nIf at less than the max stamina.\n\nStamina is regenerated by taking the current stamina and adding the stamina regen rate. This is wrapped in a clamp expression to avoid going under the minimum (0) or over the maximum (the Hero object variable heroMaxStam)\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": {
                "inverted": true,
                "value": "StringObjectVariable"
              },
              "parameters": [
                "Hero",
                "heroFSM",
                "=",
                "\"Dash\""
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": {
                "inverted": true,
                "value": "StringObjectVariable"
              },
              "parameters": [
                "Hero",
                "heroFSM",
                "=",
                "\"Death\""
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": {
                "value": "NumberObjectVariable"
              },
              "parameters": [
                "Hero",
                "heroStam",
                "<",
                "Hero.heroMaxStam"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": {
                "value": "SetNumberObjectVariable"
              },
              "parameters": [
                "Hero",
                "heroStam",
                "=",
                "clamp(Hero.heroStam + Hero.heroStamRegen, 0, Hero.heroMaxStam)"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "associatedLayout": "Stage",
      "name": "CameraManagement",
      "events": [
        {
          "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment",
          "color": {
            "b": 109,
            "g": 230,
            "r": 255,
            "textB": 0,
            "textG": 0,
            "textR": 0
          },
          "comment": "At the beginning of the scene, hide the Camera Room objects."
        },
        {
          "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": {
                "value": "SceneJustBegins"
              },
              "parameters": [
                ""
              ]
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": {
                "value": "Hide"
              },
              "parameters": [
                "CameraRoom"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": {
                "value": "Hide"
              },
              "parameters": [
                "BossRoom"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment",
          "color": {
            "b": 109,
            "g": 230,
            "r": 255,
            "textB": 0,
            "textG": 0,
            "textR": 0
          },
          "comment": "As long as the player is in collision with the CameraRoom object and not the BossRoom, center the camera on the player WITHIN the CameraRoom object's boundaries.\nThis selects the current CameraRoom the player is in, and ensures the cameras stay within that range. In the future if the game was to be expanded with different rooms, this would mean it would flip the camera to the new CameraRoom boundaries once you enter it.\nWe duplicate this event for the Dash and Death effect layers, since they should both always mirror the main layer."
        },
        {
          "colorB": 228,
          "colorG": 176,
          "colorR": 74,
          "creationTime": 0,
          "name": "Camera Movement",
          "source": "",
          "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Group",
          "events": [
            {
              "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "type": {
                    "value": "CollisionNP"
                  },
                  "parameters": [
                    "HeroHitbox",
                    "CameraRoom",
                    "",
                    "",
                    ""
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "actions": [],
              "events": [
                {
                  "colorB": 228,
                  "colorG": 176,
                  "colorR": 74,
                  "creationTime": 0,
                  "name": "Parallax",
                  "source": "",
                  "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Group",
                  "events": [],
                  "parameters": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment",
                  "color": {
                    "b": 109,
                    "g": 230,
                    "r": 255,
                    "textB": 0,
                    "textG": 0,
                    "textR": 0
                  },
                  "comment": "The parralax layer cameras should not move unless the main camera is moving, so their position is related specifically to the position of the base layer's camera position."
                },
                {
                  "type": "BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard",
                  "conditions": [],
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "type": {
                        "value": "SetCameraCenterX"